A flowchart diagrams processes, decisions, and workflows using directional nodes and edges. Use it for algorithms, business processes, decision trees, and system state flows. Uses `flowchart`.

---

!! Basic example

```
flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B{Is it working?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Great!]
    B -->|No| D[Fix it]
    D --> B
```

$$$text/vnd.tiddlywiki.mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B{Is it working?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Great!]
    B -->|No| D[Fix it]
    D --> B
$$$

---

!! Real-world example: Software deployment pipeline

This example shows a CI/CD workflow from a developer commit through build, test, staging review, and production deployment. Node categories are color-coded: actors, trigger events, pipeline stages, gates, and warning paths.

```
%%{init: {"flowchart": {"curve": "monotoneX"}}}%%
flowchart TD
    accTitle: Software deployment pipeline
    accDescr: CI/CD workflow from commit to production

    %% ── Trigger ────────────────────────────────
    DEV([Developer]):::actor --> COMMIT[Git Commit]:::trigger

    %% ── Build stage ─────────────────────────────
    COMMIT --> BUILD[Build and Test]:::stage
    BUILD -->|pass| STAGE[Staging Deploy]:::stage
    BUILD -->|fail| NOTIFY[Notify Dev]:::warning

    %% ── Production gate ─────────────────────────
    STAGE --> REVIEW{Manual Review}:::gate
    REVIEW -->|approve| PROD[Production Deploy]:::stage
    REVIEW -->|reject| NOTIFY
    PROD --> DONE(["End State"]):::actor

    %% ── Class definitions ───────────────────────
    classDef actor   fill:#6c757d,stroke:#495057,color:#fff
    classDef trigger fill:#0d6efd,stroke:#084298,color:#fff
    classDef stage   fill:#198754,stroke:#0f5132,color:#fff
    classDef warning fill:#dc3545,stroke:#842029,color:#fff
    classDef gate    fill:#fd7e14,stroke:#984c0c,color:#fff
```

$$$text/vnd.tiddlywiki.mermaid
%%{init: {"flowchart": {"curve": "monotoneX"}}}%%
flowchart TD
    accTitle: Software deployment pipeline
    accDescr: CI/CD workflow from commit to production

    %% ── Trigger ────────────────────────────────
    DEV([Developer]):::actor --> COMMIT[Git Commit]:::trigger

    %% ── Build stage ─────────────────────────────
    COMMIT --> BUILD[Build and Test]:::stage
    BUILD -->|pass| STAGE[Staging Deploy]:::stage
    BUILD -->|fail| NOTIFY[Notify Dev]:::warning

    %% ── Production gate ─────────────────────────
    STAGE --> REVIEW{Manual Review}:::gate
    REVIEW -->|approve| PROD[Production Deploy]:::stage
    REVIEW -->|reject| NOTIFY
    PROD --> DONE(["End State"]):::actor

    %% ── Class definitions ───────────────────────
    classDef actor   fill:#6c757d,stroke:#495057,color:#fff
    classDef trigger fill:#0d6efd,stroke:#084298,color:#fff
    classDef stage   fill:#198754,stroke:#0f5132,color:#fff
    classDef warning fill:#dc3545,stroke:#842029,color:#fff
